  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统管路穿过水密舱壁时的水密套管安装和防火分隔合规要求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P048-01" level="1" requirementType="installation">
      <sysml:Name>管路水密穿舱安装</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>系统管路穿过水密舱壁时，应采用焊接式水密套管，确保水密完整性。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P048" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-WELD-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-WELD-002" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IFACE-INST-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>水密完整性失效可能导致舱室进水，影响船舶稳性和安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查安装图纸和现场，确认水密套管为焊接式结构。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>水密套管焊缝应满足船级社无损检测要求，具体检测比例按船级社规范确认。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>安装后应进行水密试验，试验压力按船级社规范或项目技术规格书确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【管路水密穿舱安装】，来自原始需求「采用焊接式水密套管」。E-SUPP-WELD-001 和 E-SUPP-WELD-002 间接支撑了穿舱处焊接质量要求；E-IFACE-INST-001 间接支撑了穿舱详图提交要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
